                                "sense_id": "ddf0c1f6-16dd-350c-bb47-76fcb1117d86",
                                "text": "The flashing signal is intended mainly for use at crossings with lifting barriers, but it may be also be used at some gated crossings and, on minor roads, at some ungated crossings; [...]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3514136-79bb-451c-b072-b3d2b441a493",
                                "sense_id": "ddf0c1f6-16dd-350c-bb47-76fcb1117d86",
                                "text": "Gated, gilded and gaudy, they have sprung up all over China: overwrought government buildings erected at vast public expense, and in stark contrast to the shoddy state of so many homes and schools. In style they range from modernist brutalism to Versailles kitsch."
